    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wife is a desktop pet game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Instructions:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports gaze tracking with the mouse, dragging, and interacting with different parts of the character by clicking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Right-click the character to open the settings menu and activate a practical voice Pomodoro timer,let Wife to cheer you on for work and study!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increase affection over time to deepen your bond, unlock hidden content, and earn achievements!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Contents:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a cute, energetic girl desktop pet wife.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Model Authors:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Project Planner: @\u8def\u8fc7\u7684\u732b\u7a9d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3D Artist: \u8def\u8fc7\u7684\u732b\u732b@passer-by21456</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Illustrator\uff1a@\u660a\u5195_</p>",
